  "scope": "Finite unchanged client fd.a(gs), Player-positive fd.b(sn), awake/empty fd.y, duplicate identities and genuine registered NULL WorldAccess failure after publications. Actual fd/wy/rh/gr/dc/ok/lm owners and CPU chunk acquisition; no Player NBT success, entering a bed, renderer callback, tick/input/render/network/audio or full-startup parity claim. Native authored controls additionally test callback reentry/error, zero provider capacity, typed holds/retirement, actual sleeping cells and failed NBT base prefixes."
